    "customfield_12313320": "<div style='font-weight:bold;color:red;text-align:center'>This project has a <a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/discussion.html\">user mailing list and an IRC channel</a> for support. If you are looking for support, or if you are not sure whether the behavior that you are observing is expected or not, please discuss it there first.</div>",
    "customfield_12314134": null,
    "duedate": null,
    "customfield_12314132": null,
    "customfield_12314131": null,
    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12428198/comment/12721024",
          "id": "12721024",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jasonrutherglen",
            "name": "jasonrutherglen",
            "key": "jasonrutherglen",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Jason Rutherglen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Taking a step back, maybe we can solve the package protected\nSegmentInfo issue here by creating a new class with the\nnecessary attributes?\n\nHere's what LUCENE-1313 does:\n\n{code} SegmentReader sr = writer.readerPool.getIfExists(info);\nif (info.hasDeletions() || (sr != null && sr.hasDeletions())) {\n{code}\n\nBecause SegmentInfo is package protected it seems ok to access a\npackage protected method (or in this case variable) in\nIndexWriter.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jasonrutherglen",
            "name": "jasonrutherglen",
            "key": "jasonrutherglen",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Jason Rutherglen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2009-06-18T01:27:22.530+0000",
          "updated": "2009-06-18T01:27:22.530+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12428198/comment/12721404",
          "id": "12721404",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Attached patch.\n\nI added a test case showing it, then took that same approach (from LUCENE-1313) and the test passes.\n\nI also found that with NRT, because the deletions are applied before\nbuilding the CFS after flushing, we wind up holding open both the\nnon-CFS and CFS files on creating the reader.  So, I changed deletions\nto flush after the CFS is built.\n\nI plan to commit in a day or two.\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2009-06-18T18:36:27.594+0000",
          "updated": "2009-06-18T18:36:27.594+0000"
        },
        {
